(7491463, 1192807, 112739, '<td valign="top">For some reason, I had just noticed the day before this challenge ended that you had not received a Blue ribbon yet. And then the very next day, you got a Blue ribbon! Made me smile big. Congrats on your first Blue and hope you stick around. I''ve been to the Cave of the Mounds when I was a kid growing up in northern IL. Don''t really remember it, but congrats on creating a great image from there.</td>', 'For some reason, I had just noticed the day before this challenge ended that you had not received a Blue ribbon yet. And then the very next day, you got a Blue ribbon! Made me smile big. Congrats on your first Blue and hope you stick around. I''ve been to the Cave of the Mounds when I was a kid growing up in northern IL. Don''t really remember it, but congrats on creating a great image from there.', '2017-01-09 22:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
